dard population.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Rates involving firearm homicide or suicide counts <20 are not presented because of concerns about statistical instability\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"For simplicity in this report, comparisons are nominal and do not involve formal statistical testing; however, such comparisons are restricted to statistically stable rates.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Counties were grouped according to four fixed poverty ranges, each covering approximately one quarter of the overall 2019 U.S. population.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}